<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>404 - Topilmadi</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background: #f5f5f5; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 2rem; }
    .error-box { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 3rem; text-align: center; max-width: 400px; }
    .error-code { font-size: 6rem; font-weight: 700; color: #2563eb; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .error-title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .error-text { color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 1rem 2rem; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
    .btn:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-box">
    <div class="error-code">404</div>
    <h1 class="error-title">Sahifa topilmadi</h1>
    <p class="error-text">Kechirasiz, siz qidirgan sahifa mavjud emas yoki o'chirilgan.</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn">🏠 Bosh sahifaga qaytish</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>